@startuml
title CLI Scenario: Load a Grid and Show the Next Generation

actor Player
participant "CLI Command Handler" as Command
participant "CLI Grid File I/O" as Files
participant "Game Engine Text Codec" as Codec
participant "Game Engine Rules Engine" as Rules
participant "CLI Terminal Presenter" as Presenter
participant "File System" as FS

autonumber

Player -> Command: request grid load
Command -> Files: read grid text
Files -> FS: read plain text file
FS --> Files: grid text
Files --> Command: grid text
Command -> Codec: parse grid text
Codec --> Command: in-memory grid
Command -> Presenter: show grid
Presenter --> Player: rendered grid

Player -> Command: request next generation
Command -> Rules: compute next generation
Rules --> Command: next-generation grid
Command -> Presenter: show next generation
Presenter --> Player: rendered grid
@enduml
